- models.dev has no entry for a `unified` SKU in the Gemma 4 line (the catalog lists `gemma-4-31b`, `gemma-4-26b-a4b`, `gemma-4-12b-*`, `gemma-4-e4b`, `gemma-4-e2b` variants but no "unified").
